Open Transcript | ctrl-t | Global open_transcript Open Transcript Open the transcript overlay. tui.keymap.global.open_transcript ctrl-t Default
Open External Editor | ctrl-g | Global open_external_editor Open External Editor Open the current draft in an external editor. tui.keymap.global.open_external_editor ctrl-g Default
Copy | ctrl-o | Global copy Copy Copy the last agent response to the clipboard. tui.keymap.global.copy ctrl-o Default
Clear Terminal | ctrl-l | Global clear_terminal Clear Terminal Clear the terminal UI. tui.keymap.global.clear_terminal ctrl-l Default
Toggle Vim Mode | unbound | Global toggle_vim_mode Toggle Vim Mode Turn Vim composer mode on or off. tui.keymap.global.toggle_vim_mode unbound Default
Toggle Raw Output | alt-r | Global toggle_raw_output Toggle Raw Output Toggle raw scrollback mode. tui.keymap.global.toggle_raw_output alt-r Default
Open Permissions Popup | unbound | Global open_permissions_popup Open Permissions Popup Open the permissions popup. tui.keymap.global.open_permissions_popup unbound Default
Interrupt Turn | esc | Chat interrupt_turn Interrupt Turn Interrupt the active turn. tui.keymap.chat.interrupt_turn esc Default
Decrease Reasoning Effort | alt-,, shift-down | Chat decrease_reasoning_effort Decrease Reasoning Effort Decrease reasoning effort. tui.keymap.chat.decrease_reasoning_effort alt-,, shift-down Default
Increase Reasoning Effort | alt-., shift-up | Chat increase_reasoning_effort Increase Reasoning Effort Increase reasoning effort. tui.keymap.chat.increase_reasoning_effort alt-., shift-up Default
Set Reasoning Effort Low | alt-1 | Chat set_reasoning_effort_low Set Reasoning Effort Low Set reasoning effort to low. tui.keymap.chat.set_reasoning_effort_low alt-1 Default
Set Reasoning Effort Medium | alt-2 | Chat set_reasoning_effort_medium Set Reasoning Effort Medium Set reasoning effort to medium. tui.keymap.chat.set_reasoning_effort_medium alt-2 Default
